<title>USA: MBIA qualifies three issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>MBIA qualifies three issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp said it has qualified for bond insurance the following three municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Charles Stewart Col., Mich., $6.025 million general obligation improvement bonds.</p>
<p>--New Hope-Solebury S.D., Pa., $22.515 million GOs under the alternative bidding program.</p>
<p>--Harris County MUD #345, Texas, $2.49 million GO bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
